From e92011edd6c270ed0282beb3ff0889f80ead62b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 23:51:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 23/34] WP13: Per-request query, DB-time and lock-time logging

Integration: db.py import conflict with WP06 (threading) kept both imports. scheduler.py conflicts with WP07 heartbeats: the ical job logs its run line (WP13) then pings its heartbeat (WP07); the mail job pings on success and then logs its run line.

Integration with WP23: _job_deadlines writes one run line for the whole job, with at_risk, unknown_risk, awaiting_retry, host_mails and digest counts next to alerts and requests_due; ok=0 when the alert pass or the watchdog failed; the filing heartbeat is pinged after the line.
